meta {
  name: What Ink sees beside a piece
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/pieces/{{pieceId}}/related
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Three lists: related, forgotten and loose, each note with its own opening lines, title and dates. Only your own pieces. Close means close in meaning; pieces without a vector yet fall back to sharing words. Needs pieceId to be a piece of yours that has words.
}
